## 2. What H11 is (and is not)

| Is | Is not |
| --- | --- |
| Policy: when FPGA UF aborts, host runs **MWPM** (PyMatching / equivalent) on the **same** DEM + syndrome | Claiming UF is “wrong” whenever logicals disagree with MWPM (M5b: disagree expected; both completed) |
| Triggers + status bits on the H10 egress path | Inventing a timeout threshold without measured rates |
| Gate FPGA→CPU offload on **measured** timeout / unsolved frequency | Routing every shot to MWPM “just in case” |
| Surface-code graphlike DEM path | Relay-BP / qLDPC fallback (separate stack; Overview) |

